{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>影后衛詩雅（Michelle）昨日（24日）迎來42歲生日，她在社交平台曬出與醫美醫生老公周祉安（Kenley）共進燭光晚餐及夜遊山頂的合照，大讚對方安排簡單又浪漫，兩公婆恩愛放閃惹人羨慕。</p><figure><img alt=\"衛詩雅42歲生日。（IG@michellewsn）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202285410953203712642739.jpeg/tvDw-APKLqXbRvfDXvrauuawJIq_GU58X_UkuV_1JLk\"/><figcaption>衛詩雅42歲生日。（IG@michellewsn）</figcaption></figure><p>兩人低調全黑襯到絕</p><p>衛詩雅與老公當晚選址一間佈置充滿聖誕氣氛的高級西餐廳「撐枱腳」。二人以全黑情侶裝上陣，衛詩雅身穿黑色吊帶低胸裙配搭同色系長褸，展現優雅小性感；老公則以黑色西裝配圓框眼鏡示人，斯文大方。席間兩人除了享用精緻西餐外，枱上更特別準備了印有「Happy Birthday」字樣的黑膠唱片造型蛋糕，並插上蠟燭慶祝，儀式感十足。</p><figure><img alt=\"與老公撐抬腳。（IG@michellewsn）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202285428133597184085947.jpeg/iLTwFYsHUEM7h_W9pQiZQRwuaE7F6TsUcm6rbXJuq20\"/><figcaption>與老公撐抬腳。（IG@michellewsn）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"相當Sweet！（IG@michellewsn）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202285425549774848746239.jpeg/P9HfnzkStI5KhESoBsqljZgoswfJa_lHteAL8bXgC_E\"/><figcaption>相當Sweet！（IG@michellewsn）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黑膠蛋糕慶祝。（IG@michellewsn）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202285423465074688062513.jpeg/LSAVZRWFIZd4ROfdqxEaGj9d4NoMq44-LTE6hi0xOoY\"/><figcaption>黑膠蛋糕慶祝。（IG@michellewsn）</figcaption></figure><p>飯後直奔山頂吹風</p><p>享用心意滿滿的生日晚餐後，老公原來還準備了飯後餘興節目，親自駕車載衛詩雅上山頂夜遊吹風。在多張夜晚自拍中，衛詩雅面露幸福甜笑並緊貼老公合照，完全沉醉在二人世界之中。她在帖文中甜蜜留言多謝老公為自己慶祝一個簡單又浪漫的生日，更搞笑踢爆對方飯後專登車她上山頂「吹30秒風」，直呼「真係好浪漫呀」，閃盲一眾網民。</p><figure><img alt=\"飯後直奔山頂夜遊吹風。（IG@michellewsn）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202285421078384640498723.jpeg/426QAirkK0uoh7VSNy444K3GHi7pukWOkZgFP5GYBT8\"/><figcaption>飯後直奔山頂夜遊吹風。（IG@michellewsn）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"超浪漫！（IG@michellewsn）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261125/1202285418704277504861237.jpeg/lzvQ5ERSoZiJszSLJlP_El3qAAfwbZLtww89dcMPPXU\"/><figcaption>超浪漫！（IG@michellewsn）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T11:54:48.013406+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":575,"images":6,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:15:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T12:17:22.242751+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T11:48:13.764022+00:00","content_hash":"b34c371368b3b88df51ce32398bd0bc1f51e048bda397597588b6f7d676dc905","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}